    "text": "Trending Story\nUpdated 03:13 AM UTC, Thu June 19, 2025\nDeath of 60s Singer Lou Christie\nA 5-year-old boy is recovering from a self-inflicted gunshot wound in Fayette County. The Pennsylvania State Police and the District Attorney are investigating to determine if charges should be filed.\nSacco family\n\"He was cherished not only by his family and close friends, but also by countless fans whose lives he touched with his kindness and generosity.\"\nComments\nfeddup\nDouched? Edit the damn thing. RIP to Mr.Christie and condolences to his family and friends...he brought a lot of joy to us all... and the Gypsy Cried.🙏\n6\nFulton Miklos\nA Pittsburgh classic. Thank you and God rest your soul Mr. Christie!🙏\n5\nGreg Leeb\nI remember his music, as I enjoyed “oldies” music as a teen. God rest his soul.\n4\nEnd Abuse\nSoo sad ! Enjoyed his music . RIP 🙏🏼\n3\nDonald F. Leyman\nPrayers for the Sacco family. 🙏 I'm sorry to hear of his passing. Loved his music. Was jamming out to Lightnin’ Strikes at work today. RIP Lou Christie. Thank you for entertaining us all these years.\n3",
